\par\par \b \uc2 A Whiff Of Possible  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Snaps The Euro From Its Lows\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jessica Mead   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 535 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2011\par 19:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones Business News\par \uc2 DJON\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LONDON -(Dow Jones)- Financial markets are in a hypersensitive yet whimsical mood.\par \par \uc2 A veritable rout in the euro in early European trade Tuesday was somehow reversed in the late morning by the merest whiff of official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in peripheral euro-zone debt markets. That comeback maintained a mostly steady tone in U.S. hours even as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to materialize.\par \par \uc2 For those who were tracking the market prices as they tumbled, the turnaround is very odd indeed. Where hours earlier there had been signs of capitulation, now there is an eerie calm.\par \par \uc2 Yet there has been no change to the circumstances which triggered the morning massacre. The lack of guidance from policymakers on moves to agree on a new bailout for Greece and stop other bigger, indebted dominoes from falling have not gone away.\par \par \uc2 If anything, with Italian and Spanish borrowing costs at euro-era highs, the weight of evidence still points to an intensification of the euro zone debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 In any case, European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying of Italian and Spanish government debt, whether directly or indirectly through other central banks, is just not a sustainable course of action, such is mountain of debt that these two countries owe and need to rollover.\par \par \uc2 But after pushing the euro lower against every other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and to fresh all-time lows against the safe-haven Swiss franc, traders bought back the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , enabling it to pare back much of the day's losses.\par \par \uc2 The trigger was unsubstantiated rumors of bond-buying by the central banks and rumors of more buying continued to circulate.\par \par \uc2 But then so does talk of an imminent Greek default amid continued signs of policy paralysis within the European Union.\par \par \uc2 Willem Buiter\uc2 , \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 's chief economist, has warned that the ECB needs to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  "on whatever scale is necessary" in Italy's 10-year bond auction Thursday or risk its failure.\par \par \uc2 It's fair to say that would likely upset the market further. As it is, with yields on 12-month Italian t-bills at an auction on Tuesday surging to 3.67% from 2.147% a month earlier, the omens are hardly positive.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also a nagging factor halfway around the world, in Japan, as panic caused by the euro-zone's debt crisis sends investors flocking to safe havens like the Japanese yen.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, traders dumped euros and snapped up yen. That helped bash the dollar down to Y79.17, the lowest since \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with other Group of Seven major industrialized nations to weaken the yen after the Japanese tsunami.\par \par \uc2 Japanese Finance Minister Noda lost little time in warning traders that the yen is now in dangerous territory.\par \par \uc2 But strategists doubt Japan will be able to convince other G7 members to help them this time.\par \par \uc2 "There's a big difference between rallying around Japan in March after the earthquake and doing so now. If we get \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it will be unilateral," said Kit Juckes, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2  in London.\par \par \uc2 By Jessica, Mead, Dow Jones Newswires;\par \par \uc2 jessica.mead@dowjones.com [ 07-12-11 1306ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJON000020110712e77c0004y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
